earthkit-plots colour styles
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes colour styles derived from earthkit-plots
(https://github.com/ecmwf/earthkit-plots), version 1.0.4 (commit
5b7f94db4db5101ffc4ad4d6383d456ea79cb9e5), Copyright 2022- European Centre for
Medium-Range Weather Forecasts (ECMWF), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of the licence is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

The styles were converted from YAML and modified: flattened to discrete bands,
out-of-range behaviour taken from 'extend', units mapped, renamed and grouped
by quantity. The modified styles are in
georiva/src/georiva/core/style_catalogue/earthkit-plots-1.0.4.json, generated by
georiva/scripts/earthkit_styles/generate.py from the list in
georiva/scripts/earthkit_styles/catalogue.yml.

