Magics colour styles
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product includes colour styles derived from Magics
(https://github.com/ecmwf/magics), commit
cb97794b8830e9fdcd2f40e659d8070d74bf60af, Copyright 1996- European Centre for
Medium-Range Weather Forecasts (ECMWF), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. A copy of the licence is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

The styles were converted from Magics' named contour styles and modified:
shaded styles only, translated to levels and one colour per band as Magics
draws them, units and groups taken from Magics' rule files, renamed. The
modified styles are in
georiva/src/georiva/core/style_catalogue/magics-cb97794b.json, generated by
georiva/scripts/magics_styles/generate.py with the choices in
georiva/scripts/magics_styles/catalogue.yml and corrections.yml.

